Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Bob says you delivered as agreed, but an important part was missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.18,0:00:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.08,0:00:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer, damn it, when you're asked something!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.76,0:00:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come here playing tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.30,0:00:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't think that. Leave him. I've known him since he was a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.19,0:00:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He drifts off now and then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.12,0:00:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hitting him won't help. The boy is sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.42,0:00:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But we must find out what he did with her head.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.30,0:00:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think a couple of punches would help.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:00:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he's like that because he's been beaten too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.82,0:00:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen. I've been kind to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.36,0:01:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I let you live here in return for
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.88,0:01:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,tidying up after our film shoots now and then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.76,0:01:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not too much to ask, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.82,0:01:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If not for me, you'd be in a madhouse in a straitjacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.34,0:01:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.62,0:01:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to make up for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.48,0:01:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll get hold of that head.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.50,0:01:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Or else we'll get another one instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.16,0:01:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Kate's, for example.
